## Interface: 11509
## Title: Spoken Quests
## Notes: Quest and gossip dialogue read aloud, through the Spoken player. Formerly VoiceOver Redux. Restores quest and gossip voiceovers on current Classic clients.
## Notes-deDE: Quest- und Tratschdialoge, vorgelesen durch den Spoken-Player. Ehemals VoiceOver Redux. Stellt die Quest- und Tratsch-Vertonungen auf aktuellen Classic-Clients wieder her.
## Notes-esES: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través del reproductor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes Classic actuales.
## Notes-esMX: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través del reproductor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes Classic actuales.
## Notes-frFR: Dialogues de quêtes et de discussions lus à voix haute grâce au lecteur Spoken. Anciennement VoiceOver Redux. Restaure les voix des quêtes et discussions sur les clients Classic actuels.
## Notes-ptBR: Diálogos de missões e conversas lidos em voz alta através do reprodutor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura as vozes de missões e conversas em clientes Classic atuais.
## Notes-ruRU: Диалоги заданий и сплетен, озвученные через проигрыватель Spoken. Ранее — VoiceOver Redux. Возвращает озвучку заданий и сплетен на текущих клиентах Classic.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken 플레이어로 퀘스트와 잡담 대사를 소리내어 읽습니다. 이전 이름은 VoiceOver Redux. 최신 Classic 클라이언트에서 퀘스트와 잡담 음성을 복원합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 播放器朗读任务和闲聊对话。前身为 VoiceOver Redux。 在当前的经典怀旧服客户端上恢复任务和闲聊语音。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 播放器朗讀任務和閒聊對話。前身為 VoiceOver Redux。 在當前的經典客戶端上恢復任務和閒聊語音。
## Version: 2.2.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SpokenQuests\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: SpokenQuestsDB
## OptionalDeps: SpokenPlayer, VoiceOverRedux
# Spoken is the player this addon speaks through: optional, so a hand-installed copy
# without it loads and says what is missing; addon managers install it from the
# CurseForge dependency. VoiceOverRedux is this addon's old name: a TOC-only tombstone
# that keeps the old SavedVariables file loading, listed so it loads first and the
# migration in VoiceOver.lua finds it.
## Group: SpokenQuests
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-VoiceOver-Player: 1

